      "Bug fix: the computer opponent now correctly handles 'Must Move If Able' pieces. Previously the bot would end its turn without moving required pieces. It now detects and moves them — using a forced move for free-action pieces and constraining its last action to the required piece when 'Forced Move Uses an Action' is on.",
      "Delete account: replacing the browser's built-in confirm dialog with a styled in-app modal. The modal shows the account name and requires an explicit 'Delete' or 'Cancel' choice. This applies everywhere accounts can be deleted — your own profile, admin user management, and the player page.",
